/.config/hypr/hyprviz.conf
/.config/wlogout/style.css
# Artifacts of the Qt6 file:// home-URL bug (literal 'file:' dirs); fixed in
# the state singletons but keep ignoring them so they never get committed.
**/file:/
**/file:
# Dependency + build trees: never meaningful to commit, and collapsing them
# keeps `git status` (and the editor's untracked badges) fast and relevant.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/

# Runtime logs: personal artifacts (contain the original developer's HOME
# paths), never part of a clean store — ignore so they never get committed.
*.log
**/*.log
